eech:<br /><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=CVPKGH131HQ\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=CVPKGH131HQ</a></p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Content Warning:</strong> This episode contains discussion of death, suicide, murder, Anti-Semitism, Nazism, genocide, violence, and swearing</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Episode Credits:</strong><br />Hosted by Isabella Robinson featuring Lorenzo Occhialini<br />Produced by WMNJ &amp; Isabella Robinson<br />Show Artwork by Isabella Robinson<br />Special Thanks to WMNJ board, Professor Blatter, and the Robinson Family</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Theme Music: Take Your Girlie to the Movies (If You Can’t Make Love At Home) from the Library of Congress - Composed by Pete Wendling and Sung by Billy Murray: <a href=\"https://www.loc.gov/item/jukebox-33050/\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.loc.gov/item/jukebox-33050/</a></p><p><em style=\"color:rgb(44,44,44);font-family:'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);\">Subscribe to this podcast and leave a review on Spotify, Apple Podcasts, or wherever you get podcasts! Discover more <a href=\"https://www.wmnjradio.com/\" style=\"background:transparent;color:rgb(75,100,255);\" rel=\"nofollow\">WMNJ</a> and <a href=\"https://duparchive.org/\" style=\"background:transparent;color:rgb(75,100,255);\" rel=\"nofollow\">DUPA</a> content at <a href=\"https://www.wmnjradio.com/\" style=\"background:transparent;color:rgb(75,100,255);\" rel=\"nofollow\">wmnjradio.com</a> and <a href=\"https://duparchive.org/\" style=\"background:transparent;color:rgb(75,100,255);\" rel=\"nofollow\">duparchive.org</a>!</em><br /></p>","language":"eng","licenseurl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-nd/4.0/","scanner":"Internet Archive HTML5 Uploader 1.7.0","subject":["Motion Picture Matchmaker","dupa_audio","dupa_podcast","WMNJ"],"title":"Motion Picture Matchmaker ||  Anatomy of a Fall + The Zone of Interest (E11)","uploader":"wmnj@drew.edu","collection_added":"aud